      "key": "information_presented",
      "title": "Candidate Interview information and responsibilities presented",
      "guidance": "Record what was actually explained; do not use a signature as a substitute for delivery.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "key": "presented_topics",
          "type": "checklist",
          "label": "Candidate Interview acknowledgment topics",
          "items": [
            "Role, interview stage, duration, and participant names were presented",
            "Interview format, technology, location, and time zone were confirmed",
            "Candidate received a route for requesting an interview adjustment",
            "Panelists received only the information needed for their assigned role",
            "Structured questions and rating anchors were available before the interview",
            "Candidate questions and next-step expectations were addressed",
            "No medical, family-history, genetic, age, or other non-job-related inquiry is recorded",
            "Recording, note retention, and work-sample handling followed stated policy"
